&lt;p&gt;At Freenow, we are on a mission to empower smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; New Business&lt;/strong&gt; team. You will own a vertical focused on complex, high-value order types, the kind that don&#39;t fit into a simple A-to-B booking and require real product thinking to scale. Think multi-leg journeys, recurring enterprise needs, scheduled operations, and bespoke partner requirements. This list is not exhaustive the space is wide and still being defined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will set the vision for your vertical, build the roadmap from scratch, and take full ownership of outcomes. This is not an execution role with a predefined plan. You are the one who creates the plan.&lt;/p&gt;
